{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"1":"Purification (Kitab Al-Taharah)"},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":1,"hadithnumber_last":390,"arabicnumber_first":1,"arabicnumber_last":390,"name_native":"كتاب الطهارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":46,"arabicnumber":46,"text":"حدثنا قتيبة بن سعيد، عن سفيان، عن ابي الزناد، عن الاعرج، عن ابي هريرة، يرفعه قال \" لولا ان اشق، على المومنين لامرتهم بتاخير العشاء وبالسواك عند كل صلاة","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (887، 7240) Sahih Muslim (252)"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":46}}]}